UID:vjYHBdkBfT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 104 mins (1h44m)\n\nA crime writer and his film prof
 essor partner become caught up in a real-life mystery of their own when th
 ey witness a crime in the apartment across the courtyard of their Paris ap
 artment building.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/murder-in-the-building\
 n\nEstimated start: 15:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Balandrau\, Where the Fierce Wind Blew
DTSTART:20260516T010000Z
DTEND:20260516T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T010000Z
UID:MBY4JaBQkT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 116 mins (1h56m)\n\nOn December 30\, 2000\, friends 
 climbing Mount Balandrau in the Catalan Pyrenees get caught in a sudden\, 
 savage blizzard. Visibility vanishes\, winds roar\, and survival becomes a
  desperate fight against one of the mountain’s deadliest storms. Produce
 r Guille Cascante scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ba
 landrau-where-the-fierce-wind-blew\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:I Want Your Sex
DTSTART:20260516T041500Z
DTEND:20260516T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T041500Z
UID:CJfSfHXHkJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nWhen fresh-faced Elliot (Cooper H
 offman) lands an exciting job for renowned artist\, icon\, and provocateur
  Erika Tracy (Olivia Wilde)\, his fantasies come true as Erika taps him to
  become her sexual muse.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/i-want-your-sex\
 n\nEstimated start: 21:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fifteen
DTSTART:20260516T065900Z
DTEND:20260516T085400Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T065900Z
UID:CLxaoLtyqy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nGrowing up is terrifying enough\,
  but for two best friends planning the ultimate quinceañera\, the real ho
 rror is what's growing inside one of them. Producer Yossy Zagha scheduled 
 to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/fifteen\n\nEstimated start: 0:
 14
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sons of the Neon Night
DTSTART:20260516T183000Z
DTEND:20260516T205000Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T183000Z
UID:DQcmX4IuqF
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 124 mins (2h04m)\n\nAn elite cast of Hong Kong actio
 n legends assemble for this sprawling\, mega-budget thriller that hearkens
  back to the wildly ambitious\, hyper-stylized crime cinema that put Hong 
 Kong filmmaking on the international map.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival
 /sons-of-the-neon-night\n\nEstimated start: 11:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Powwow People
DTSTART:20260516T213000Z
DTEND:20260516T233500Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T213000Z
UID:ZfGbQv2R8o
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 106 mins (1h46m)\n\nPowwow People immerses us in a s
 ingle day at a powwow\, guided by Reuben Little Head’s humor and heart\,
  culminating in a long take honoring community as privilege. Director Sky 
 Hopinka (Ho-Chunk Nation/Pechanga Band of Luiseño Indians) scheduled to a
 ttend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/powwow-people\n\nEstimated start: 
 14:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:It Would Be Night in Caracas
DTSTART:20260517T013000Z
DTEND:20260517T032500Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T013000Z
UID:0BMEoi7BQ8
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nSet in Caracas during the 2017 pr
 otests\, this gripping social thriller follows a woman trapped in a city c
 onsumed by repression and chaos. When regime loyalists seize her apartment
 \, she is forced into hiding and begins to hatch a desperate plan in a per
 ilous bid to escape the country.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/it-would
 -be-night-in-caracas\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chili Finger
DTSTART:20260517T041500Z
DTEND:20260517T061000Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T041500Z
UID:k6alrciddk
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nWhen a human finger is accidenta
 lly served in a cup of fast-food chili\, the restaurant\, its horrified cu
 stomers\, and the digitless victim all scramble over who gets blamed\, and
  who gets paid\, in this queasy black comedy.Directors Edd Benda and Steph
 en Helstad scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/chili-fin
 ger\n\nEstimated start: 21:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Furious
DTSTART:20260517T065900Z
DTEND:20260517T090900Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T065900Z
UID:wehJX6Q0ql
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 113 mins (1h53m)\n\nAfter the daughter of Wang Wei (
 Xie Miao) is kidnapped by a criminal network and he receives no help from 
 the corrupt police\, Wei sets out on a rampage to find her himself. His on
 ly ally is Navin (Joe Taslim) – a relentless journalist whose wife has m
 ysteriously disappeared. Fueled by a furious vengeance\, the unlikely duo 
 ruthlessly fights against the kidnappers in this explosive martial arts sh
 owdown.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-furious\n\nEstimated start: 0
 :14
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Prisoners of the Earth (1939)
DTSTART:20260517T203000Z
DTEND:20260517T221500Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T203000Z
UID:34eG8ty9KR
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 86 mins (1h26m)\n\nThe most acclaimed film by one of
  classic Argentine cinema’s foremost directors is a gut-punching work of
  social realism: a group of desperate men are conscripted to labor on a tr
 eacherous plantation—a situation that boils over in an explosive act of 
 rebellion.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/prisoners-of-the-earth\n\nEsti
 mated start: 13:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sundays
DTSTART:20260517T230000Z
DTEND:20260518T011500Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T230000Z
UID:9gKSXh34CY
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 117 mins (1h57m)\n\nAt 17\, Ainara faces a life-chan
 ging choice: after high school\, she considers becoming a nun. Her decisio
 n unsettles her family\, especially her aunt Montse\, who fears it means l
 osing freedom. The year's Goya Award standout offers a stirring tale about
  the fragile balance between faith and skepticism.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net
 /festival/sundays\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Invite
DTSTART:20260518T020000Z
DTEND:20260518T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T020000Z
UID:g2wD31Ftqe
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nJoe and Angela’s marriage is o
 n thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinn
 er party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited t
 he spark or lit the match that burns it all down? Director & star Olivia 
 Wilde scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-invite\n\n
 Estimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
